  806: def monotone_majorant(raw):
  807:     """Conservative one-sided PAV: the smallest function >= raw that is
  808:     non-decreasing in dens and non-increasing in alen, per stratum. A single
  809:     cummax pass per axis is exact because the alen-cummax of dens-monotone
  810:     slices stays dens-monotone. Only ever RAISES the FDR estimate."""
